0097    E EAFNOSUPPORT, address family not supported by protocol family
0098    E EADDRINUSE, address already in use
0099    E EADDRNOTAVAIL, cannot assign requested address, not available
0100    E ENETDOWN, network is down
0101    E ENETUNREACH, network is unreachable
0102    E ENETRESET, network dropped connection because of reset
0103    E ECONNABORTED, software caused connection abort
0104    E ECONNRESET, connection reset by peer
0105    E ENOBUFS, no buffer space available
0106    E EISCONN, transport endpoint is already connected
0107    E ENOTCONN, transport endpoint is not connected
0108    E ESHUTDOWN, cannot send after transport endpoint shutdown
0109    E ETOOMANYREFS, too many references: cannot splice
0110    E ETIMEDOUT, connection timed out
0111    E ECONNREFUSED, connection refused
0112    E EHOSTDOWN, host is down
0113    E EHOSTUNREACH, host is unreachable, no route to host
0114    E EALREADY, operation already in progress
0115    E EINPROGRESS, operation now in progress
0116    E ESTALE, stale NFS file handle
0117    E EUCLEAN, structure needs cleaning
0118    E ENOTNAM, not a XENIX named type file
0119    E ENAVAIL, no XENIX semaphores available
0120    E EISNAM, is a named type file
0121    E EREMOTEIO, remote I/O error
0122    E EDQUOT, quota exceeded
0123    E ENOMEDIUM, no medium found or no medium in drive
0124    E EMEDIUMTYPE, wrong medium type
0125    E ECANCELED, operation canceled
0126    E ENOKEY, required key not available
0127    E EKEYEXPIRED, key has expired
0128    E EKEYREVOKED, key has been revoked
0129    E EKEYREJECTED, key was rejected by service
0130    E EOWNERDEAD, previous owner died
0131    E ENOTRECOVERABLE, state not recoverable
0132    E ERFKILL, operation not possible due to RF-kill
0133    E EHWPOISON, memory page has a hardware error
0137    E ECASECLASH, filename exists with different case
